      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{解答：过球心的纵截面建立坐标系如图.}\\\\&amp;\\text{则半圆方程为}\\\\&amp;\\quad x^{2}=2Ry-y^{2}\\\\&amp;\\text{设经过}t\\text{秒容器内水深为}h,\\text{则}h=h(t).\\text{由题设，经过}t\\text{秒后容器内的水量为}at,\\text{而高为}h\\text{的球缺的体积为}\\\\&amp;\\quad V(h)=\\int_{0}^{h}\\pi(2Ry-y^{2})hy\\\\&amp;\\text{故有}\\int_{0}^{h}\\pi(2Ry-y^{2})dy=at\\\\&amp;\\text{两边对}t\\text{求导，得}\\\\&amp;\\quad\\pi(2Rh-h^{2})\\frac{dh}{dt}=a\\\\&amp;\\text{所以}\\frac{dh}{dt}=\\frac{a}{\\pi(2Rh-h^{2})}\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{解答：过球心的纵截面建立坐标系如图.}\\\\&amp;\\text{则半圆方程为}\\\\&amp;\\quad x^{2}=2Ry-y^{2}\\\\&amp;\\text{设经过}t\\text{秒容器内水深为}h,\\text{则}h=h(t).\\text{由题设，经过}t\\text{秒后容器内的水量为}at,\\text{而高为}h\\text{的球缺的体积为}\\\\&amp;\\quad V(h)=\\int_{0}^{h}\\pi(2Ry-y^{2})hy\\\\&amp;\\text{故有}\\int_{0}^{h}\\pi(2Ry-y^{2})dy=at\\\\&amp;\\text{两边对}t\\text{求导，得}\\\\&amp;\\quad\\pi(2Rh-h^{2})\\frac{dh}{dt}=a\\\\&amp;\\text{所以}\\frac{dh}{dt}=\\frac{a}{\\pi(2Rh-h^{2})}\\end{aligned}</div>"
